```LSASS Memory Dump via comsvcs.dll MiniDump | sigma: rules/windows/credential_access/proc_creation_lsass_dump_comsvcs_minidump.yml```
`dac_windows_process_creation` Image="*\\rundll32.exe" OR OriginalFileName="RUNDLL32.EXE" CommandLine="*comsvcs*" CommandLine IN ("*MiniDump*", "*#24*", "*#+24*", "*#-4294967272*")
